Q: Why do two floats that give the same output when printed not compare equal? A: <p><a href="http://php.net/manual/en/language.types.float.php" rel="nofollow">http://php.net/manual/en/language.types.float.php</a> see that big red warning banner. :)</p>

<p>For comparing floats you can use:</p>

<pre><code>if (abs($nt1-$nt2) &lt; 0.00001) {
    echo "Equal!";
}
</code></pre>

<p>(change <code>0.00001</code> to comparison precision you need).</p>

Q: How can I connect to database using playwright A: <p>The following code uses a pool to serve several concurrent tests run by different Workers.</p>
<p>Define a fixture in a file named as you want, <code>database.ts</code> here:</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>import { test as base } from '@bgotink/playwright-coverage';
import mysql from 'mysql2/promise';
import type { Pool } from 'mysql2/promise';

interface CustomFixtures {
   dbPool: Pool;
}

const test = base.extend&lt;CustomFixtures&gt;({
   dbPool: async ({}, use) =&gt; {
      const pool = mysql.createPool({
         host              : 'localhost',
         user              : 'aubin',
         password          : process.env.DB_PASSWORD,
         database          : 'dbname',
         timezone          : 'Z',
         waitForConnections: true,
         connectionLimit   : 1, // Ensures only one connection per worker
         queueLimit        : 0,
      });
      await use(pool);
      await pool.end(); // Clean up after tests
   },
});

export { test };
</code></pre>
<p>In your test, use it as follow:</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>import { expect } from '@bgotink/playwright-coverage';
import { test } from './database';
import mysql from 'mysql2/promise';

test.describe(() =&gt; {

   const jour  = 2;
   const debut = '16:00';

   test.afterAll(async({dbPool}) =&gt; {
      await dbPool.query(`DELETE FROM pauses WHERE jour = ${jour  } AND debut = '${debut  }:00';`);
   });

   test(`${TESTS_PREFIX}Insertion d'une pause`, async ({ page, dbPool }) =&gt; {
      const fin   = '16:15'; // à  16:15:00
      await page.goto('http://localhost:5173/agenda/');
      await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Paramètres...' }).click();
      const paramJour = page.locator('#param-jour');
      const paramDe   = page.locator('#param-de');
      const paramA    = page.locator('#param-a');
      const ajouter   = page.locator('#param-add');
      await paramJour.selectOption(`${jour}`);
      await paramDe  .fill(debut);
      await paramA   .fill(fin);
      await ajouter.click();
      await expect(async () =&gt; {
         const [rows] = await dbPool.query(`SELECT * FROM pauses WHERE jour = ${jour} AND debut = '${debut}:00';`);
         const result = rows as mysql.RowDataPacket[];
         expect(result.length).toBe(1);
         const row     = result[0];
         const dbJour : number = row.jour;
         const dbDebut: string = row.debut;
         const dbFin  : string = row.fin;
         expect(dbJour).toEqual(jour);
         expect(dbDebut).toEqual(`${debut}:00`);
         expect(dbFin).toEqual(`${fin}:00`);
      }).toPass({ timeout: 1000 });
   });
});
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Note</strong>: I use <code>@bgotink/playwright-coverage</code> which extends <code>playwright</code>.</p>
